        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ringmei ram njuanmei nun rui,",
            "He Jehovah jailoumei puta ninge;",
            "Kauh pumtan lana rihsu pukho,",
            "Bumang thanmei rui suaihiam louna,",
            "Kagun daimei lu suan.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ai bampui ram hei mu jingpui ram e,",
            "Hanguang datro jat guaina lung khou hei;",
            "Khanglou kanmei rianramei guai,",
            "Ringmei kandih 2!- ai hou khang.",
            "",
            "2. Guang ganno ganphiu banchuang rui,",
            "Kanloumei neimik 2!-rui gan guang datro;",
            "Reikhou kanan khou jailoumei kum,",
            "Nang ringmei duikhun gaimei khou 2!-,",
            "Rianra guai khiu than khang.",
            "",
            "3. Nang ram mak hei kandih khou hei,",
            "Kandih rihlung khou rianra bam khuan sini;",
            "Rihpuan piuna ai rih suni the,",
            "Kalvari jaujian lum loumei guaiRui seitan ta ngamni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
